  <Intro>k__BackingField: The knights burned the coven's tower and sang while it fell. Ysolde crawled out of the black water with a dozen of the dead behind her. The witch hunters still camp at the edge of the fen, waiting to see what else comes out.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The hunters' camp is ash, and their dead stand up to serve you. The fen is quiet again, the way you like it.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Take the witch hunters' town.
  <Loss>k__BackingField: Ysolde must not fall.
